{"name": "Broadside Bets", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Command the crew, play your hand, FIRE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This isn't a casino.\u00a0This is war... and the stakes are your ship and your crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"62\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617170/extras/4a25fed8aa9f436e1216eec92095a319.webp?t=1783497912\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"558\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617170/extras/7b6168b92b67f8631ebc448f6bf9ad9f.poster.avif?t=1783497912\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617170/extras/7b6168b92b67f8631ebc448f6bf9ad9f.webm?t=1783497912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617170/extras/7b6168b92b67f8631ebc448f6bf9ad9f.mp4?t=1783497912\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Steer your ship through uncharted seas to discover islands, treasure and merchants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Destroy your foes, upgrade your poker hands and collect rule-bending Booty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"62\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617170/extras/81008c47abfbc5f265b4e3a7e49db737.webp?t=1783497912\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video aria-label=\"Booty foorage\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"622\" loop=